sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant API as Messaging API
  participant DB as MySQL
  actor Hotel as Hotel staff

  Guest->>API: Open conversation for own booking
  API->>DB: Find or create booking conversation
  API-->>Guest: Conversation details
  Guest->>API: Join chat room via Socket.IO
  Hotel->>API: Join chat room via Socket.IO
  Note over Guest,Hotel: Room joins require conversation access

  Guest->>API: Send message via HTTP with retry key
  API->>API: Check access, send window and content
  API->>DB: Lock thread, allocate sequence and save message
  Note over API,DB: Commit message and inbox preview together
  API-->>Guest: chat:message via Socket.IO
  API-->>Hotel: chat:message via Socket.IO
  API-->>Guest: HTTP response with saved message

  Hotel->>API: Mark latest message read via HTTP
  API->>DB: Advance reader cursor
  API-->>Guest: chat:read receipt via Socket.IO
  API-->>Hotel: Read confirmation
  Note over API,Hotel: Missed realtime updates are recovered from HTTP history
